c{1}{x+2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{{x}^{3}}{3}{|}_{0}^{1}+{x}^{2}{|}_{0}^{1}-x{|}_{0}^{1}+3\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x+2|{|}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}({1}^{3}-{0}^{3})+({1}^{2}-{0}^{2})-(1-0)+3(\\operatorname{ln}⁡|1+2|-\\operatorname{ln}⁡|0+2|) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}+1-1+3(\\operatorname{ln}⁡3-\\operatorname{ln}⁡2) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}+3\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\,\\frac{3}{2}\\,).\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357280 1000 #edb/ref 17592186357281 13194139535606 true] [17592186357280 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535606 true] [17592186357280 1041 "field-1" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357280 1104 #edb/ref 17592186357281 13194139535606 true] [17592186357280 1110 #uuid "a60bc9ba-3203-5719-bb3f-6e744554fe41" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357281 1034 "\\frac{1}{3}" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357281 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535606 true] [17592186357281 1111 #uuid "2feece16-a794-537c-ab0e-3ea2d33aae10" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357282 1000 #edb/ref 17592186357283 13194139535606 true] [17592186357282 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535606 true] [17592186357282 1041 "field-2" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357282 1104 #edb/ref 17592186357283 13194139535606 true] [17592186357282 1110 #uuid "adb7ccbc-e175-525a-8d7d-0c5567347034" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357283 1034 "\\frac{3}{2}" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357283 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535606 true] [17592186357283 1111 #uuid "8dc12e0a-46c9-5ea2-afa2-66efff04e2f8" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357284 1017 #edb/ref 17592186357285 13194139535606 true] [17592186357284 1089 "q-49415" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357284 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535606 true] [17592186357284 1100 "$\\int \\frac{{x}^{2}+5x+1}{x+3}\\,\\text{d}x=$" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357284 1113 #uuid "91d9290d-0194-58f2-86f3-0cadf7eccc60" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357284 1145 "We first need to decompose the integrand into its quotient and remainder parts, which we can do using synthetic division.\n\nWe draw up a synthetic division table:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & {x}^{2} & {x}^{1} & {x}^{0} \\\\ -3 & 1 & 5 & 1 \\\\  & ↓ & -3 & -6 \\\\  & 1 & 2 & -5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo from the synthetic division, we get that\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}+5x+1}{x+3}=x+2-\\frac{5}{x+3}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{x}^{2}+5x+1}{x+3}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (x+2-\\frac{5}{x+3})\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int x\\,\\text{d}x+2\\int \\text{d}x-5\\int \\frac{1}{x+3}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}{x}^{2}+2x-5\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x+3|+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357285 1000 #edb/ref 17592186357286 13194139535606 true] [17592186357285 1000 #edb/ref 17592186357287 13194139535606 true] [17592186357285 1000 #edb/ref 17592186357288 13194139535606 true] [17592186357285 1000 #edb/ref 17592186357289 13194139535606 true] [17592186357285 1000 #edb/ref 17592186357290 13194139535606 true] [17592186357285 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535606 true] [17592186357285 1041 "selection" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357285 1104 #edb/ref 17592186357288 13194139535606 true] [17592186357285 1110 #uuid "01fd1dcb-b2c8-5152-a056-5f3f1a41a604" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357286 1034 "2{x}^{2}-6x-5\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x+3|+C" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357286 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535606 true] [17592186357286 1111 #uuid "72126ad0-84c8-5a90-ba69-b6f05dbd46f2" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357287 1034 "\\frac{1}{2}{x}^{2}-x+2\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x+3|+C" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357287 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535606 true] [17592186357287 1111 #uuid "f5bc6780-18a0-5bd5-8402-03158911531f" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357288 1034 "\\frac{1}{2}{x}^{2}+2x-5\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x+3|+C" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357288 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535606 true] [17592186357288 1111 #uuid "48d6c464-1327-5ea0-89aa-1b6ed8ae41ea" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357289 1034 "\\frac{1}{2}{x}^{2}+x-\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x+3|+C" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357289 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535606 true] [17592186357289 1111 #uuid "5c441154-fbfc-5d81-9968-21f6ddfebbca" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357290 1034 "2{x}^{2}-4x+3\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x+3|+C" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357290 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535606 true] [17592186357290 1111 #uuid "50518d53-d5d9-5742-a8b0-bfc04c18cbe8" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357291 1017 #edb/ref 17592186357292 13194139535606 true] [17592186357291 1089 "q-49463" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357291 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535606 true] [17592186357291 1100 "Calculate $\\int \\frac{x+2}{2x-3}\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357291 1113 #uuid "fe19f1ff-58de-5fa5-b5fd-cb354b85476e" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357291 1145 "First, we pull out the factor of $2$ from the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{x+2}{2x-3}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{x+2}{2(x-\\frac{3}{2})}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\frac{x+2}{(x-\\frac{3}{2})}\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we draw up our synthetic division table to decompose the integrand into its quotient and remainder.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & x & {x}^{0} \\\\ \\frac{3}{2} & 1 & 2 \\\\  & ↓ & \\frac{3}{2} \\\\  & 1 & \\frac{7}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo from the synthetic division, we get that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{x+2}{(x-\\frac{3}{2})} & =1+\\frac{(\\frac{7}{2})}{(x-\\frac{3}{2})} \\\\  & =1+\\frac{7}{2(x-\\frac{3}{2})} \\\\  & =1+\\frac{7}{2x-3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{x+2}{2x-3}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int (1+\\frac{7}{2x-3})\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}[\\int \\text{d}x+7\\int \\frac{1}{2x-3}\\,\\text{d}x] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}[x+\\frac{7}{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|2x-3|]+C \\\\  & =\\frac{x}{2}+\\frac{7}{4}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|2x-3|+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357292 1000 #edb/ref 17592186357293 13194139535606 true] [17592186357292 1000 #edb/ref 17592186357294 13194139535606 true] [17592186357292 1000 #edb/ref 17592186357295 13194139535606 true] [17592186357292 1000 #edb/ref 17592186357296 13194139535606 true] [17592186357292 1000 #edb/ref 17592186357297 13194139535606 true] [17592186357292 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535606 true] [17592186357292 1041 "selection" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357292 1104 #edb/ref 17592186357295 13194139535606 true] [17592186357292 1110 #uuid "ddd0705c-c1cc-51fb-92b4-f58d5f5d3b1c" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357293 1034 "x+\\frac{2}{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|2x-3|+C" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357293 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535606 true] [17592186357293 1111 #uuid "21d7072b-9dc3-53f7-bf21-3c2bd3af1fe1" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357294 1034 "x-\\frac{3}{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|2x-3|+C" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357294 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535606 true] [17592186357294 1111 #uuid "72010525-d447-51a5-97f4-5ac28e6d9839" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357295 1034 "\\frac{x}{2}+\\frac{7}{4}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|2x-3|+C" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357295 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535606 true] [17592186357295 1111 #uuid "9d917623-494a-5a44-93bb-1002e8dab193" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357296 1034 "2x-3\\operatorname{ln}⁡|2x-3|+C" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357296 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535606 true] [17592186357296 1111 #uuid "5f40ebb6-e412-57f4-a537-9532a5f39f12" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357297 1034 "\\frac{x}{2}-4\\operatorname{ln}⁡|2x-3|+C" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357297 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535606 true] [17592186357297 1111 #uuid "e166d08f-fedf-5624-a398-67be8ab29086" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357298 1017 #edb/ref 17592186357299 13194139535606 true] [17592186357298 1089 "q-49465" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357298 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535606 true] [17592186357298 1100 "$\\int \\frac{x+1}{3x+2}\\,\\text{d}x=$" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357298 1113 #uuid "1fd799ff-202c-5050-9c9c-9e1ee127439a" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357298 1145 "First, we pull out the factor of $3$ from the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{x+1}{3x+2}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{x+1}{3(x+\\frac{2}{3})}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}\\int \\frac{x+1}{(x+\\frac{2}{3})}\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we draw up our synthetic division table to decompose the integrand into its quotient and remainder.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & x & {x}^{0} \\\\ -\\frac{2}{3} & 1 & 1 \\\\  & ↓ & -\\frac{2}{3} \\\\  & 1 & \\frac{1}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo from the synthetic division, we get that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{x+1}{(x+\\frac{2}{3})} & =1+\\frac{(\\frac{1}{3})}{(x+\\frac{2}{3})} \\\\  & =1+\\frac{1}{3(x+\\frac{2}{3})} \\\\  & =1+\\frac{1}{3x+2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{x+1}{3x+2}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{3}\\int (1+\\frac{1}{3x+2})\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}[\\int \\text{d}x+\\int \\frac{1}{3x+2}\\,\\text{d}x] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}[x+\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|3x+2|]+C \\\\  & =\\frac{x}{3}+\\frac{1}{9}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|3x+2|+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357299 1000 #edb/ref 17592186357300 13194139535606 true] [17592186357299 1000 #edb/ref 17592186357301 13194139535606 true] [17592186357299 1000 #edb/ref 17592186357302 13194139535606 true] [17592186357299 1000 #edb/ref 17592186357303 13194139535606 true] [17592186357299 1000 #edb/ref 17592186357304 13194139535606 true] [17592186357299 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535606 true] [17592186357299 1041 "selection" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357299 1104 #edb/ref 17592186357303 13194139535606 true] [17592186357299 1110 #uuid "0fe1e80d-2ebc-5303-a8a0-68e8484f67e3" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357300 1034 "3x-9\\operatorname{ln}⁡|3x+2|+C" 13194139535606 true] [17592186357300 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535606 true] [17592186357300 1111 #uuid "14a0d934-927d-5e77-bc4f-12c282fe5